-We follow the ESANet authors' preprocessing and weight initialization.
-RGB images use the normalization required by the pretrained encoder.
-Depth values are normalized using the mean and standard deviation of
-valid readings from ISOD training images; these same values are used on
-GTE-Floor. Missing depth readings follow the authors' raw-depth
-preprocessing.
