-U-Net uses an ImageNet-pretrained MobileNetV2 encoder, batch size 8,
-AdamW with learning rate \(3\times10^{-4}\) and cross-entropy plus soft
-Dice loss. YOLOv8n-seg uses pretrained RGB weights, 640-pixel inputs and
-batch size 16. For YOLO, training masks are converted to polygons; its
-predicted object masks are combined for evaluation.
